# コンソール (design 16.5.19), for tools/ui_run.py: the accessory opened from its program
# (its window at 100,80 to 760,500), the place it starts in, bin (pwd typed in the full-width
# letters the system starts with), the links of bin listed by their names, hello run with an
# argument and its exit code, a name that is nothing, ".." up to "/", hello run from there,
# the object システム by its UUID, the プログラム箱 gone into by a name typed in 日本語 (ぷろぐらむ turned to
# katakana with Shift+無変換) and completed with Tab, and back to bin. Last, the command hello
# opened from the desktop as a double press opens it: run in a コンソール of its own.
open 01a0d8c4-5219-7c3e-8a41-2f6b9d0e5c11
wait 1500
win コンソール
click 420 300
wait 200
text pwd
key 28
expect /bin
# 半角
key 35
text ls
key 28
expect [コマンド] hello
expect [コマンド] v8prog
text hello
key 2C
text 7
key 28
expect hello from a TessronOS process
expect arguments: 7
expect hello: 終了コード 7
text nosuch
key 28
expect nosuch: そういう命令もプログラムもありません
text cd
key 2C
text ..
key 28
text pwd
key 28
expect /> pwd
text ls
key 28
expect [実身] bin/
expect [実身] home/
text hello
key 2C
text 3
key 28
expect hello: 終了コード 3
wait 300
shot con_root
# the object システム by its UUID
text cd
key 2C
text 01a0d8c4-5211-7c52-9e0a-3b61d27f4c85
key 28
text ls
key 28
expect [実身] プログラム箱/
# cd プログラム: the kana turned to katakana, committed, and the name completed
text cd
key 2C
key 88
text puroguramu
key 8B 02
wait 300
shot con_ime
key 28
# 英数 right after the Enter that commits: each key is read in the mode it came in (T_OBNTM imode)
key 39
key 2B
wait 200
shot con_tab
key 28
expect システム> cd プログラム箱/
text ls
key 28
expect [小物] 時計
text cd
key 28
text pwd
key 28
expect bin> pwd
wait 300
shot con_back
# hello opened from the desktop: a コンソール started for it runs it
open 01a0d8c4-5462-7c93-8ea4-bc1d2e3f5462
expect hello: 終了コード 0
wait 500
shot con_open
absent !OACV!
